  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -IR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: confundido (regular)",
    "*Siempre confundo por y para* = I always mix up por and para",
    "Reflexive *confundirse* = to get confused, to make a mistake: *Me confundí de calle* = I got the wrong street",
    "*Confundir a alguien con alguien* = to mistake someone for someone else: *Te confundí con tu hermano* = I mistook you for your brother",
    "Related: la confusión (confusion), confuso/a (confused/confusing), el malentendido (misunderstanding)"
  ],
